// Syncthing ignore list for the emu-save-dolphin folder.
// Deployed by chezmoi, gated on the `emulation` role.
//
// The folder root is Dolphin's whole flatpak data dir; only the three save
// directories should cross hosts. Caches and dumps are large and per-host.
//
// First match wins, so every include precedes the catch-all. Each directory
// needs two lines: `!/GC` admits the directory, `!/GC/**` its contents.
// Without the second, only an empty directory syncs.

!/GC
!/GC/**
!/Wii
!/Wii/**
!/StateSaves
!/StateSaves/**

// Everything else: Cache/, Dump/, Load/, ShaderCache/, Logs/, config, ...
**
